  "observations": [
    "Initial module/version lookup returned MIME-Charset-1.013_01 for the bundled 1.012.2 label. Its bytes did not match; it was excluded. The exact named 1.012.2 release passed complete-file comparison.",
    "Tk and two core Perl modules differ only by the retained PAR::Packer 1.055 literal compatibility patches; the full transformed bytes match.",
    "common-sense 3.75 has a generated module rather than a matching original .pm file and remains outside the verified CPAN archive list. Its source lookup is not treated as source-byte verification.",
    "The first download control used macOS /var through its filesystem symlink, which the output guard refused. The fixture now resolves its temporary root; all eight final controls pass.",
    "Forty-four source distributions lack a recognized standalone notice filename. Their README and anchor-module texts are retained for embedded grant review.",
    "Biber README declares Artistic 2.0, while its Build.PL metadata declares perl. Both original texts and the complete Artistic 2.0 text are preserved; this record does not resolve redistribution obligations."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Map generated core/Unicode/autosplit files, native modules and libraries to complete build/source/license evidence.",
